Error: Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed: `bucket.values` cannot be assigned while `window` is still looking into it
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/field_assignment_conflicts_with_live_view.jet:8:12
    |
  8 |     bucket.values = [4, 5]
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `bucket.values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `bucket.values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed
